  "name": "Pokémon Card Game LEGEND Perfect Set",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "A set sold in limited numbers in Japan from 10 July 2010 at cinemas showing that summer's Pokémon film, Zoroark: Master of Illusions, and at Pokémon Centers. It held one pack each of HeartGold Collection, SoulSilver Collection, Reviving Legends and Clash at the Summit, eleven cards with two holos per pack, and always three special holo cards of shiny (色ちがい) Entei, Suicune and Raikou. The film makes a shiny trio of the Legendary Beasts the protectors of its Crown City.",
